ADA v2 Alembic migrations directory.

생성: Day01 v2.2 §3 (베이스라인)
실제 revision: Day02 부터 (ada/db/models.py 가 갖춰지면 `alembic revision --autogenerate -m "init"` 실행).

Usage
-----
    # 로컬:
    DATABASE_URL=postgresql://autoai:CHANGE@localhost:5433/autoai \
        alembic upgrade head

    # 도커(컨테이너 내부):
    docker compose exec api alembic upgrade head
